      "solution_type": "turnkey",
      "description": "Keeping a private lawn cut without anyone pushing or driving a mower.",
      "what_decides": "Lawn size and the steepest slope decide. How the mower finds the edge of the lawn (a buried wire, satellite positioning or cameras) decides how much work the installation is; makers describe that in different ways, so it is not compared here.",
